Display stayed dark because the overlay bound i2c0 to the crystal pins (P0.00/P0.01) on nice_nano_v2, so the SSD1306 never saw the bus.

- Display/I2C: remap i2c0 SCL/SDA to P0.26/P0.24 in the shield overlay pinctrl entries to use usable GPIOs.

Example overlay change:
```dts
&pinctrl {
    i2c0_default: i2c0_default {
        group1 {
-           psels = <NRF_PSEL(TWIM_SCL, 0, 1)>, <NRF_PSEL(TWIM_SDA, 0, 0)>;
+           psels = <NRF_PSEL(TWIM_SCL, 0, 26)>, <NRF_PSEL(TWIM_SDA, 0, 24)>;
        };
    };
}
```

